{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Colonization Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 2352680,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352680/extras/89080a8d3138a952c385e2ecc2171b0f.avif?t=1733425652\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colonize rich planets with vegetation or deserted moons. Build a functional and prosperous colony.  Take care of your colonists. Experience adventures on distant worlds or build a colony on planets in our solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colonization Simulator gives you the opportunity to colonize many planets that have different climates, fauna, flora and conditions for colonization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your colonists and develop them professionally. You can choose specialisations and assign different tasks. Invent new technologies and improve your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On unknown planets, you'll encounter different animals, alien civilizations and have many adventures. While managing your colony, you'll be faced with many decisions that will affect how the colony runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you will find in the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The opportunity to colonize different planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- many planets and moons of our solar system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- distant worlds rich in vegetation and animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- encounters with alien civilizations </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- many species of animals on planets where life thrives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- concern for the colonists, the possibility of their specialization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- trade in raw materials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- planetary exploration</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352680/extras/89080a8d3138a952c385e2ecc2171b0f.avif?t=1733425652\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colonize rich planets with vegetation or deserted moons. Build a functional and prosperous colony.  Take care of your colonists. Experience adventures on distant worlds or build a colony on planets in our solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colonization Simulator gives you the opportunity to colonize many planets that have different climates, fauna, flora and conditions for colonization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your colonists and develop them professionally. You can choose specialisations and assign different tasks. Invent new technologies and improve your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On unknown planets, you'll encounter different animals, alien civilizations and have many adventures. While managing your colony, you'll be faced with many decisions that will affect how the colony runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you will find in the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The opportunity to colonize different planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- many planets and moons of our solar system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- distant worlds rich in vegetation and animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- encounters with alien civilizations </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- many species of animals on planets where life thrives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- concern for the colonists, the possibility of their specialization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- trade in raw materials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- planetary exploration</p>",
